u003eCollect cute dumplings of different rarities, from Common, Rare, Epic, and Legendary to the ultra-rare Rainbow Dumpling and Golden Dumpling.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eComplete each collection to unlock the exclusive Secret Dumpling and finish every mystery theme.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFeatures\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🥟 Relaxing ASMR unboxing experience\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎁 Open mystery dumpling boxes\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌈 Discover Rainbow \\u0026amp; Golden Dumplings\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e⭐ Collect Common, Rare, Epic \\u0026amp; Legendary characters\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🏆 Complete every collection and unlock Secret Dumplings\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e✨ Cute animations and satisfying reveal effects\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eStart your Mystery Dumpling collection today and see if you can find every rare surprise!\"],\"Brocker Bus Studio\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/hV3J-Dr_Cq0HEoe9Lb8OlWBf2AeltWebnYzrp64ygmqQLPK9CdNzUJzFHX8qytac-PVx-NAiOoHxaikqRnn1cw\"],null,[223,111,194,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,[null,\"Suitable for all age groups. Some violence in a comical or fantasy context is acceptable. Bad language is not permitted.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/s