on the weirdly cute Battle Cat army!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e****************************\\u003cbr\\u003e* \\u0026quot;The Battle Cats\\u0026quot; requires a network connection for reliable access to gameplay features.\\u003cbr\\u003e* Downloading or updating \\u0026quot;The Battle Cats\\u0026quot; requires a stable network connection to prevent errors.\\u003cbr\\u003eA notification of a large download will appear before installation.\\u003cbr\\u003eIf you are not in a location with strong Wi-Fi, please uncheck the \\u0026quot;Update over Wi-Fi only (Android)\\u0026quot; option or turn “Use Cellular Data\\u0026quot; on before you begin downloading. \\u003cbr\\u003eAn unstable connection environment during download and/or updates may result in installation issues. \\u003cbr\\u003e* There will be regular updates for \\u0026quot;The Battle Cats\\u0026quot; with new and improved features. However, some older devices may not be able to support these changes.\\u003cbr\\u003ePlease be aware of this before you update. If there are any problems, please feel free to contact our tech support at support_en@bc01.ponos.net\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e****************************\\u003cbr\\u003eBefore you start playing, please read the \\u0026quot;Terms of Use\\u0026quot; carefully. \\u003cbr\\u003eBy downloading and playing \\u0026quot;The Battle Cats\\u0026quot;, you agree to these Terms.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTerms of Use\\u003cbr\\u003ehttps://ponosgames.com/reg/en/agreement/index.html\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy Policy\\u003cbr\\u003ehttps://ponosgames.com/reg/en/policy/index.html\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePresented by PONOS\"],\"PONOS Corporation\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/t6c24tXah9pBj-an9ht3X4s8Mf8xm8UZyo63CYLLXfOK3Gv7i90zqTbfQXP7qOP8ZgjOZhqSnXhuc40_1yGTlfo\"],null,[243,246,246,255]],null,[\"Rated for 12+\",[null,2,[366,512],[null,null,\"https://pla