AXH1ezkadvhDDBb3gCC3NEdcpuCJy74xSPFCeLjvBk-SjMwbIPOM5J5qjdd01GWNx5tmFynIl3p-HL-q7UKdbDN_s6EuFZZuvijjgnMj9eTafNkQDfYwlV31bWvQU5DfaXpk98lEWXZ4AfpSkKg9CmqPqeceVhBm8ahGL6RF_XX5kCm4n65SB_Ew0BIDv63lx-QW7h3ioIjPhpd3s8pthKpwoJzKRLWHOBg3yfmT5DOAlvLPMjJBaKCaA9dlC323VZ8BreFcQ9i58CT_J9XfvHQNybyyMyv54ZXNRk7q2sac8y30Wg\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/E4gaJUv65Iw/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"This game is not a single obby, it\\u0026#39;s a real parkour adventure that takes place different scary places. Playing as a Gugu Gaga Penguin or other amazing characters, you\\u0026#39;ll have to navigate your way through numerous obstacles, test your skills, outsmart the bosses in this action packed game.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFeatures:\\u003cbr\\u003e- 11 unique maps among which you can find:\\u003cbr\\u003e   Obby Prison Escape from Barry, Find baby memerots, Escape Pizza, Escape Toy Factory,  Escape Water Prison, Escape Carnival, Capybara Escape, Escape Dentist etc\\u003cbr\\u003e- Cool characters with special abilities like Jasmine, Dracula, Frosty, Santa or Snowman\\u003cbr\\u003e- Different kinds of gear, from slap hand to jetpack\\u003cbr\\u003e- Shapeshifting! You can become a firehorse and gallop through obby prison with ease!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFREE rewards:\\u003cbr\\u003e- Complete each escape map and get a free gear, complete 4 maps and get a cute pet that also removes all ads!\\u003cbr\\u003e- Amazing daily rewards: maps, gear, skins and more!\\u003cbr\\u003e- Timing rewards: every 5 minutes that you spend in the game, you can claim a free skin from lucky box!\\u003cbr\\u003e- Glass Bridge obby parkour challenge: complete famous glass bridge to claim a free skin from the chest at the end or simply use gear if you like cheating :)\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAre you ready for thrilling action adventure and help Gugu Gaga Penguin complete all the obby that we have?\"],\"Kids Games LLC\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",