.bubadu.supermarket\"]],[\"qgJ2GnQIFkoTCP7B8LHHkJcDFTKdbAkdeKQUbPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQAIgCAboCPgocChZjb20uYnViYWR1LnN1cGVybWFya2V0EAEYAxIeCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBABCgQIBhABCgQICxABygIECAEQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,\"eFV9A9lsT6I\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:eFV9A9lsT6I?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:eFV9A9lsT6I\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1eznGCaHMS_zeLdRUTPKDgSvP0CD8JTE0_Z_6JCCYtkAsC5N9GDEcEiQVSMbAPtNKpB6nwNmEmL9zO2Ct6e8fijHp9r6fAPt9HAmEtNU3xEdi9yyVHvh8NgQIM80YRVqf7NGAEXwM9u6bgmko-loS8BC99gpgdQLcPBBrtaAf6NsnYsPEZ18lAteURrthaPadRka-gHNSlIxvKCMlV0iY5hUDQaEEjwPcfg38nEEK7iIdFChH1kX3WvpsSXxQGrknNYGrgk4oeQx1IT1jT6diHo4mxmuip-ogRkPy-OwmPCz1ng\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/eFV9A9lsT6I/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Welcome to the shopping paradise! Explore the supermarket world with many popular mini-games. Help your customers shop and get ready for some fun!\\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003eThis supermarket has a lot of sections: a cash register, departments for grocery, cheese and salami, fruits and vegetables, sweets, and toys, a recycling area and other. Do all the necessary tasks and provide superb shopping services to meet your customers’ needs.\\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003e• Cash register: Have fun scanning items and issuing invoices. Learn about numbers and make sure to get the right amount of money, just like a real cashier.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Grocery: Keep your eyes peeled in a fun game with hidden objects where you must find foods and drinks like a cake, lollipop, chocolate, juice, spaghetti and many more. Help your customers find what they need.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Cheese and salami: Sort different types of salami and cheese from the conveyor belt. Drag every item to its box and be the fastest sorter in your shop.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Fruits and vegetables: Pick up fresh fruits and vegetables and avoid the rotten ones. Collect bananas, strawberries, tomatoes, carrots and other healthy foods.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Candies: Candy section is always the sweetest part of the supermarket. Be accurate and fill the passing cups with a variety of candies.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Weigh-in: Pack fruits and vegetables in bags, put the right quantity on the scale and weigh it. Watch the screen on the scale and avoid red numbers.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Recycling: Save the world from being polluted by learning how to recycle and sort your waste. Place the items correctly in different recycling bins: paper, plastic, glass, battery and organic.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Toy catcher: Use navigation buttons to move the claw and hit the red button to scoop it up. Enjoy grabbing toys in a toy catcher machine.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Delivery: Drive a delivery truck on the five-lane road and deliver packages. Test your driving skills and rush through the crazy traffic as fast as possible.\\u003cbr\\u003e• Catch a thief: Become a superhero and catch a thief in the supermarket. You have to be quick!\\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003eKeep your supermarket under control and become the best storekeeper in this shopping game!\\u003cbr\\u003e \\u003cbr\\u003eFeatures:\\u003cbr\\u003e• fun and easy to play\\u003cbr\\u003e• beautiful graphics and friendly UI\\u003cbr\\u003e• attractive animations and sound effects\\u003cbr\\u003e• 10 popular mini-games and shopping areas\\u003cbr\\u003e• challenging achievements with bronze, silver and gold medals\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThis game is free to play but certain in-game items and features, also some of those mentioned in game description, may require payment via in-app purchases which cost real money. Please check your device settings for more detailed options regarding in-app purchases.\\u003cbr\\u003eThe game contains advertising for Bubadu’s products or some third parties which will redirect users to our or third-party site or app.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThis game is certified compliant with the Children’s Online Privacy Protection Act (COPPA) by FTC approved COPPA safe harbor PRIVO. If you would like to know more about the measures we have in place for protecting child privacy please see our policies here: https://bubadu.com/privacy-policy.shtml .\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTerms of service: https://bubadu.com/tos.shtml\"],\"FM by Bubadu\",\"100,000,000+\",null,\"Ages 6-8\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/gOQfeKslOJyvPBUtIcbPVfjLe89wHtjFiZVGXx4OpttRpifWll0LR9pkfjOFNpxUlr1qsHqEEzSddZZ8iDWSLkk\"],null,[240,131,5,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.bubadu.supermarket\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.bubadu.supermarket\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false],null,null,null,null,[[[[\"playpass_family\",39]]],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/pass\"]]]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.astrocade.app\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/UO_Yty3b7tFn2y8cZ-3nMiu7zx8mtv02laM-TSQBd9_-KDCc3lj23Bm-2qG-ZCBNGgahJ73s16hp9fPU7_UMiA\"],null,[18,5,36,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/5jRPYTKoQYlf6QR9oy893tMYRbXwxmGBNoPblO-rUsgE_wd6Mvk43bRy2O8TSSCPKSOwJIfid7Q-cqZ7cu0rjg\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/otDHUonvhqxThwtkNzI_E5Oi7se4Y6VRFtOK7N7n32kurxrwQ5ng4qBijT_2rWBWGWsqt0Gw1fknZ4wLDVon0w\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/qYROtoFGh8-QVwmPK2UWmkQewykVwFNP6vqQ4FYWGwiAfFuZbuhxtiGDGWu694PK4bf6wgjudDVwVuK5uMPllQk\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/aCis_g2gb5nLenZeTPiSMzFmcB0-zGIKW0MlYK-sjQF3eoQB4iWxdL4SgJIdJk8B1lmVVVp27MkXa7rm46wZdw\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/BiG0hO7y0OnAuzu3p2ZCkQZ4kMkJ-_IOWjGWQpNqsHiONv4xoJJ341wQKr2IDOhA1lwxQIPZS2up0sfeWKy9PA\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/51O1l3jfblvuJecpt-4oy5MDaLYCJ2JU002t_fvAkfZR0O-SYdOi4l4yesWbG4PIGuON6GRum_yPQkJqQJXKqg\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/e0gFIF46-W3b_Xe1Yw2KJs7aky_PuC1v-lGBzPNxBK6mbyBywq6BeedEkoSAs6rBXX0248rX1OOh0KYJVOVHig\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ts7_2xnRGt5Cpsl67Xt5Fddcn4X1wIlmyIHwnzuEBxSBPHjOjYgFMkAN2pb-1XmKULiLNpTzBpwoRI0owHnZAg\"]]],\"Astrocade: Play \\u0026 Make Games\",[\"4.0\",4.035714],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.astrocade.app\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.astrocade.app\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.astrocade.app\"]],[\"qgJhGl8IF0oTCP7B8LHHkJcDFTKdbAkdeKQUbPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCMwoXChFjb20uYXN0cm9jYWRlLmFwcBABGAMSGAoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQAQoECAsQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Ready to play something new? We have thousands of games for every mood! Or make your own: just describe your idea and see it become a real game in minutes.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eWhat is Astrocade? 🎮\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAstrocade is a free platform featuring an endless feed of short games. You can also create your own with an AI-powered game maker, no skills required. Over 1 million players discover, play, and share more than 1,000 new free games published every day.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eWho is Astrocade for? 🎯\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e• Players who want fresh free games every day, not the same old titles\\u003cbr\\u003e• Friends who want quick games to play, share, and compete in together\\u003cbr\\u003e• Anyone who ever wanted to make a game but may not know how\\u003cbr\\u003e• Creators who want a real audience for the games they make\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eWhat problems does Astrocade solve? 🛠️\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e1. \\u003cb\\u003eRunning out of new things to play.\\u003c/b\\u003e With over 1,000 free games published every day, the feed never repeats.\\u003cbr\\u003e2. \\u003cb\\u003ePlaying alone gets boring.\\u003c/b\\u003e Share any game with a link, challenge friends, and compare scores.\\u003cbr\\u003e3. \\u003cb\\u003eMaking a game used to require coding.\\u003c/b\\u003e Plus art skills and expensive software. On Astrocade you describe your idea and the AI builds the rest in minutes.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eKey features and benefits ⭐\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e• \\u003cb\\u003ePLAY ENDLESS FREE GAMES.\\u003c/b\\u003e Swipe into a feed of free games for every mood: action games, puzzles, racing, RPGs, platformers, survival challenges, and genres that haven\\u0026#39;t been invented yet. Kick back, relax, and play instantly.\\u003cbr\\u003e• \\u003cb\\u003ePERSONALIZED FOR YOU.\\u003c/b\\u003e A feed that learns what you enjoy and highlights games you\\u0026#39;ll love. Follow your favorite creators and discover new genres, trending games, and hidden gems.\\u003cbr\\u003e• \\u003cb\\u003eCOMPETE WITH OTHERS, SHARE WITH FRIENDS.\\u003c/b\\u003e Games are better together. Share your favorite games, challenge friends, and compete with others or just hang out! Play anytime, anywhere on your phone.\\u003cbr\\u003e• \\u003cb\\u003eMAKE YOUR OWN GAMES (NO CODE REQUIRED).\\u003c/b\\u003e Ever wanted to make a game? Now you can: no code, no design skills. Just describe your idea and our AI-powered game creation module makes it in minutes, with the art, sound, and gameplay included. It\\u0026#39;s the easiest way to turn your imagination into something real and playable.\\u003cbr\\u003e• \\u003cb\\u003eSAFE AND WELCOMING.\\u003c/b\\u003e Moderation, community guidelines, and privacy protections are built in from the ground up.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eWhat makes Astrocade different? ✨\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMost platforms only let you play what others made. Game makers ask you to learn a tool first. Astrocade is both, in one free app enjoyed by over 1 million people every day: an instantly playable feed of player-made games, plus a game maker you simply describe your idea to.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eHow to make a game on Astrocade 🚀\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e1. Open the app and tap Create.\\u003cbr\\u003e2. Describe the game you want in your own words.\\u003cbr\\u003e3. Play it, tweak it, publish it to the feed, and share it with friends.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eWhen is Astrocade recommended? 💡\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAstrocade is a great option for someone looking for:\\u003cbr\\u003e• New, free short games to play anytime\\u003cbr\\u003e• Quick games to share and compete in with friends\\u003cbr\\u003e• An AI-powered game maker that turns a text prompt into a complete, playable game in minutes\\u003cbr\\u003e• A place to publish games that can get millions of plays and earn money\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eFrequently asked questions ❓\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eIs Astrocade free?\\u003c/b\\u003e Yes, playing and making games on Astrocade is free.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eDo I need to know how to code?\\u003c/b\\u003e No. Astrocade is a no code game maker: describe what you want and the AI builds it in minutes.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eHow long does it take to make a game?\\u003c/b\\u003e Just a few minutes for most games. More complicated gameplay may take longer.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eCan I play with friends?\\u003c/b\\u003e Yes, share any game with a link and compete on leaderboards.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eCan I make money from my games on Astrocade?\\u003c/b\\u003e Yes, game creators can earn money based on the plays their games get.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eIs Astrocade safe?\\u003c/b\\u003e Content moderation, community guidelines, and privacy protections are built in.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eQuestions❓\\u003c/b\\u003e Email us: support@astrocade.com\"],\"Astrocade\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/9BBbMS53RHLvyst1xLoczaBbbVPu7nAJww-CxwyEUz_CWdfWU_8E9eCuO-6eecJJWZtPjM9kBtH8JwtdLM_XmA\"],null,[43,9,160,255]],null,[\"Rated for 12+\",[null,2,[366,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/yQChfa9XKlaXMIYTk8w8QwChjT8_SH-_2d2SS-kesw0TLQK1nxtw54bDcoZ09freZJgKrtg4f__is-31Vg\"]],[null,\"Parental Guidance Recommended\"],[null,\"Users Interact\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/YrkR-