6feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.muscle.morph.lean.run\"]],[\"qgJpGmcIGEoTCP7B8LHHkJcDFTKdbAkdeKQUbPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tR0IQALoCOwofChljb20ubXVzY2xlLm1vcnBoLmxlYW4ucnVuEAEYAxIYCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBABCgQICxAB\"],null,[null,\"Welcome to Muscle Morph, the craziest and most action-packed muscle race ever! 🏃\\u200d♂️💨 Are you ready to pump some iron, bulk up, and smash your way to victory?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eIn this thrilling running game, your goal is simple: collect, grow, smash, and win! Start as a skinny runner and collect barbells of your matching color to build massive muscles. 🏋️\\u200d♂️💪 The more you gather, the bigger and stronger you become!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBut the path to the finish line isn\\u0026#39;t easy. You will face epic obstacles that require pure brute strength! Push massive walls 🧱, swim through wild waters 🏊\\u200d♂️, pull out giant radishes 🥕, and smash heavy barriers to pieces! Every obstacle you tackle will burn your energy and make you shrink, so you must keep collecting barbells to stay huge and powerful. 🔋\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWatch out for your rivals! In Muscle Morph, size matters. 🥊 If you are bigger and stronger than your opponents, bump into them to knock them down! They will be stunned for a few seconds and drop special Black Barbells 🖤. These rare black barbells can be collected by ANYONE for a massive power boost. Crush your enemies and steal their gains!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌟 GAME FEATURES 🌟\\u003cbr\\u003e🏋️\\u200d♂️ Collect \\u0026amp; Morph: Gather matching barbells to transform your character from skinny to a giant bodybuilder!\\u003cbr\\u003e🧱 Epic Obstacles: Push, smash, swim, and pull! Test your muscles against wildly fun challenges.\\u003cbr\\u003e🥊 Knock Down Rivals: Be the biggest! Bump into smaller players to knock them out and loot their dropped Black Barbells.\\u003cbr\\u003e🏁 Fierce Racing: Balance your muscle-building strategy and speed to be the first to cross the finish line!\\u003cbr\\u003e🎮 Addictive Gameplay: Simple swipe controls with deeply satisfying mechanics and visual feedback.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDo you have what it takes to be the biggest, strongest, and fastest runner on the track? 🏆\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload Muscle Morph now, start your ultimate fitness race, and show them who is the boss! 💥🚀\"],\"AbbaYosua.Design\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/m_6hqdtumCJgSHOEZm4_90kMFP6njKFGP8WK3cx3rBG8VNEg9LNrEiEL-4zOOyXtMqyMNs79C8z9YkwxU0dM\"],null,[103,205,252,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,[null,\"Suitable for all age groups. Some violence in a comical or fantasy context is acceptable. Bad language is not permitted.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.muscle.morph.lean.run\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.muscle.morph.lean.run\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,nu