h1qd4WumCW9GlmyDnOPIQ-o3bYL5ch\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/WsLxlRdwMQThLn_4YflKptev1DK_k8zvNWwx0nhJvZEdv7CZoACmx8lMPCNrQLv0YajLtlcjryv8zSsa02N1_A\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/t4IAp7x1Db5e-6Nc8avL19uxbm2nYIWDqd-t9aSxnVkQY4wSu6cyKDNcYwMjUmEX7NTxVzupF0TdFPlfW7KMrA\"]]],\"Mini Relaxing – Stress Relief\",[\"3.8\",3.8333333],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.relaxantistressmini.game\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.relaxantistressmini.game\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.relaxantistressmini.game\"]],[\"qgJsGmoIIkoTCP7B8LHHkJcDFTKdbAkdeKQUbPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCPgoiChxjb20ucmVsYXhhbnRpc3RyZXNzbWluaS5nYW1lEAEYAxIYCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBABCgQICxAB\"],null,[null,\"Feeling stressed or bored?\\u003cbr\\u003eTake a deep breath and dive into Mini Relaxing – Stress Relief, a soothing collection of 25 offline mini games designed to calm your mind, entertain your brain, and help you unwind anytime, anywhere — no WiFi needed!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌈 Play Anywhere, Anytime\\u003cbr\\u003eLife is full of pressure — but your relaxation shouldn’t wait!\\u003cbr\\u003eWhether you’re commuting, taking a short break, or lying in bed before sleep, Mini Relaxing brings peace and joy right to your fingertips.\\u003cbr\\u003eEvery mini game loads fast and plays smoothly offline, so you can enjoy instant fun even without an internet connection.\\u003cbr\\u003eWherever you are — at home, school, work, or on the road — you can relax your mind and relieve stress anytime, anywhere.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🧩 25 Unique Mini Games in One App!\\u003cbr\\u003eEnjoy endless fun and relaxation with 25 creative, funny, and satisfying challenges:\\u003cbr\\u003e• THIEF PUZZLE – Use your wits to steal items without getting caught.\\u003cbr\\u003e• RESCUE LEOPARD – Use your imagination to rescue the trapped leopard with lines!\\u003cbr\\u003e• BEAT THE SHARK – Aim and shoot to defeat the hungry shark!\\u003cbr\\u003e• SAVE STICKMAN – Draw lines to protect the stick figure from harm.\\u003cbr\\u003e• MAZE JOURNEY – Find a way out of the maze, help the stick man get his stick, help the puppy get his bone, and help the boy go to the toilet.\\u003cbr\\u003e• LINE PUZZLE – Use your imagination to complete the picture by drawing lines.\\u003cbr\\u003e• TOILET RUSH – Help the poor guy get to the toilet in time!\\u003cbr\\u003e• SUGAR COOKIE – Cut the sugar cookie perfectly like a pro.\\u003cbr\\u003e• KILL ZOMBIE – Use your wits to successfully blow up the zombie with a bomb.\\u003cbr\\u003e• CAR JAM – Clear the traffic so the main character\\u0026#39;s car can successfully drive away.\\u003cbr\\u003e• PARKING – Park like a master! \\u003cbr\\u003e• BUILD BRIDGE – Assemble and place the perfect bridge to allow the stick man to pass safely and successfully retrieve the stick.\\u003cbr\\u003e• GUN SIMULATE – Experience weapon shooting and feel the stunning sound effects.\\u003cbr\\u003e…and many more relaxing and funny mini games waiting for you to discover!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🧠 Relax and Train Your Brain\\u003cbr\\u003eMini Relaxing isn’t just a game — it’s a mindful playground.\\u003cbr\\u003eSolve clever puzzles, improve concentration, and enjoy gentle mental stimulation while you unwind.\\u003cbr\\u003eEvery level is designed to balance calmness and creativity, helping you reset your mood without frustration.\\u003cbr\\u003eIt’s perfect for anyone who wants a few minutes of peace, mental clarity, or just a bit of fun after a busy day.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎠 Perfect for Everyone\\u003cbr\\u003eWhether you’re a kid, student, or adult, Mini Relaxing is made for all ages.\\u003cbr\\u003eNo violence, no competition — just stress-free fun and simple happiness.\\u003cbr\\u003eShort levels, easy controls, and smooth gameplay make it ideal for casual play or quick relaxation.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎁 Why You’ll Love Mini Relaxing – Stress Relief\\u003cbr\\u003e• 25 unique offline mini games in one app\\u003cbr\\u003e• Play anytime, anywhere — no WiFi needed\\u003cbr\\u003e• Perfect for stress relief and daily relaxation\\u003cbr\\u003e• Fun, family-friendly, and easy to play\\u003cbr\\u003e• Free to download with regular updates and new mini games\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e💫 Download Mini Relaxing – Stress Relief now and start your calm journey!\\u003cbr\\u003eRelax, smile, and enjoy a pocket world full of relaxing mini games — anytime, anywhere.\"],\"QY Studio\",\"5,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/H7eSZAyymLyc9MlbADVYzQ0KRwbf-EwOtWHxfGah-8SOKCjoUcRzuukOdr-5_M-cyIPCwsxRXtWySKkkjNP32oo\"],null,[47,79,104,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,[null,\"Suitable for all age groups. Some violence in a comical or fantasy context is acceptable. Bad language is not permitted.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.relaxantistressmini.game\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.relaxantistressmini.game\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026o