_TeF_ypnvVZTofx1ta7h6itgGYG9oIUBDMvc\"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/jKcqE_LRku_PlhQHVkFADw1Z6QrFoAnRuxJF-dUkVeQQNhNrjWy4mdEWF1St5IIynXJuqRJS7D5a2apKrXYcmw\"]]],\"Boom Chip: 2 Player Mini Games\",[\"4.2\",4.2],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.gsp.boomchip.blast.challenge.clash.games\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.gsp.boomchip.blast.challenge.clash.games\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.gsp.boomchip.blast.challenge.clash.games\"]],[\"qgJ8GnoIJUoTCP7B8LHHkJcDFTKdbAkdeKQUbPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCTgoyCixjb20uZ3NwLmJvb21jaGlwLmJsYXN0LmNoYWxsZW5nZS5jbGFzaC5nYW1lcxABGAMSGAoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQAQoECAsQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,\"SbZWES4UlLo\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:SbZWES4UlLo?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:SbZWES4UlLo\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1eznQ52sRBhAZEyQHb-9DUd4S6EJO62Kl63cpmgLrANglWO2CKpFKiyiA0Y6Btfmi_jikjbgPXWAf3ho3v9SqdWdpPXi3mQBTJNMwtvBXEu-4ew5yE27bl5BdpqHtrGaOE-1Y8bn7oSAXKVX8xsdXxkdgejjCyGdm88R4mzR6uh5D2juYU4-wN_9ubfUsUUKiqUHXB--3zYenDlloiRfZTNfFW_IoYZ1jQOHpuLdTclqcaMIyUha4lXDteG2OL6voMZ38C1edQRkveTGQapWbXIc-0mEUzDlSHOeztsheUeA2NA\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/SbZWES4UlLo/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"100+ mini games in ONE app! Boom Chip Clash is the all in one games app packed with free mini games — 2 player games, puzzle games, brain games, ASMR games and antistress games. 38 games play offline with no wifi, no internet needed.\\u003cbr\\u003eTired of installing app after app? This mini games collection has casual games for every mood. Duel a friend with 2 player games. Relax with ASMR antistress games. Train your brain with sort puzzle games. All free.\\u003cbr\\u003e💥 2 PLAYER GAMES — OFFLINE, ONE PHONE\\u003cbr\\u003eBoom Chip Challenge, Tic Tac Toe, Air Hockey, Football, Stone Paper Scissors, Memory Match, Knife Throw. Every 2 player game works offline — no wifi, no internet, no second phone. The best two player games for couple games, party games and family games. Pass the phone and play!\\u003cbr\\u003e🧩 PUZZLE GAMES \\u0026amp; BRAIN GAMES\\u003cbr\\u003eBall Sort, Water Sort, Nut Sort, Block Sort, Hex Sort, Block Puzzle, Wood Block Puzzle, Block Blast, Tile Match, Tap Out Blocks, Word Link, Screw Puzzle, Fold It, Unroll Ball, Snake Escape, Rotate Circle, One Line, Jigsaw. Sort puzzle games and brain games that train logic, memory and focus. Easy puzzle games to start, tricky puzzle games to master.\\u003cbr\\u003e🌊 ASMR GAMES \\u0026amp; ANTISTRESS GAMES\\u003cbr\\u003eThe biggest ASMR antistress collection in a free games app. Bubble Wrap, Fidget Spinner, Fidget Pop, Squish Ball, Slime, Soap Slice, Sand and Mud play, Kinetic Rocks, Balloon Pop, Newton\\u0026#39;s Cradle, Bamboo, Magnets, Breathe In Out. Relaxing games and satisfying games with soft sounds and soothing textures. Perfect antistress games to calm down and relax.\\u003cbr\\u003e🎹 MUSIC GAMES\\u003cbr\\u003ePiano, Drum Set, Xylophone, Woodwinds, Keyboard. Free music games — make music with one finger.\\u003cbr\\u003e🧽 SATISFYING CLEANING GAMES\\u003cbr\\u003eCar Cleaning, Pool Cleaning, Mat Cleaning, Window Cleaning, Fridge Sort, Kitchen Restore. Oddly satisfying games that turn mess into spotless.\\u003cbr\\u003e🍕 SORT GAMES\\u003cbr\\u003ePizza Sort, Cookie Sort, Bakery Sort, Fish Sort, Books Sort, Socks Sort, Flower Sort, Plant Sort, Animal Sort, Fruit Cut. Simple sort games, endless satisfaction.\\u003cbr\\u003e⚡ WHY THIS MINI GAMES APP\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e100+ GAMES IN ONE APP — all in one games, no more app hunting\\u003cbr\\u003eOFFLINE GAMES — 38 games with no wifi and no internet needed\\u003cbr\\u003e2 PLAYER GAMES — two player games on one shared phone\\u003cbr\\u003ePUZZLE GAMES + ASMR GAMES + CASUAL GAMES in a single free app\\u003cbr\\u003eQUICK GAMES — most mini games finish in under a minute\\u003cbr\\u003eEASY GAMES — simple tap controls, no tutorial\\u003cbr\\u003eFAMILY GAMES — clean, colourful, safe games for kids and adults\\u003cbr\\u003eFREE GAMES — the whole games collection, free to play\\u003cbr\\u003eSMALL \\u0026amp; FAST — extra games download only when you choose them\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e👫 GAMES FOR EVERY MOMENT\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eParty games and group games with friends\\u003cbr\\u003eCouple games and date night games\\u003cbr\\u003eFamily games for kids, parents and grandparents\\u003cbr\\u003eRelaxing games and ASMR games to wind down at night\\u003cbr\\u003eOffline games without wifi for a commute, a flight or a queue\\u003cbr\\u003eBrain games and puzzle games to sharpen your mind\\u003cbr\\u003eMini games to beat boredom in five spare minutes\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🧠 SKILL, NOT GUESSWORK\\u003cbr\\u003eThese games reward attention. Memory, observation, logic and timing decide who wins — in 2 player games and puzzle games alike. Play more, get better.\\u003cbr\\u003e😌 OR JUST RELAX\\u003cbr\\u003eNot competitive today? Open the ASMR antistress games instead. No timers, no pressure — just relaxing games and satisfying games to melt the stress away.\\u003cbr\\u003e📱 GOOD TO KNOW\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e38 offline games ready at install — including every 2 player game\\u003cbr\\u003eMore mini games download on demand, keeping the app small\\u003cbr\\u003eFree games, light and smooth on any device\\u003cbr\\u003eNew games added regularly\\u003cbr\\u003eMade purely for entertainment, with no real-money features\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDuel a friend. Solve a puzzle. Or just relax.\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload Boom Chip Clash — 100+ mini games, puzzle games, ASMR games and 2 player games in one free app!\"],\"M/S GAMING SWITCH STUDIO\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/I_UYiTkp1Pu2z1-tKXbXJzjqT-H-3pX6mFYkvlFLobl86mP-0-Qv3IYl1yO-hXFS9hJ_fd2pIRt0v4s9eBTWbA\"],null,[241,237,235,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,[null,\"Suitable for all age groups. Some violence in a comical or fantasy context is acceptable. Bad language is not permitted.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.gsp.boomchip.blast.challenge.clash.games\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.gsp.boomchip.blast.challenge.clash.games\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.mrxvip.hair.salon\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Z58Ho1XRNz4ny2kqGx0b-L19jnMACh6byMpu2YRnfBUEDUR0kCiNUiRlKxCZgqa-vBH3awWiGmOF4nhm85IWE9o\"],null,[253,204,9,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/uBQeV