xasm0?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:eeUWWsxasm0\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1eznrSih2VIUDiBN5zNSdcQm3EpfbNDFG0I_4N-C-Ie5yYwzDFvwzstDFLZ16ODRVJ7pu-qqd1d0nVwIPuG9Nx7QAQTiJ-1gY09Axq_KjzAceMqiKLd9obHxa_fguYvw6qjXyjROCw4ZOvBUnYRmxLjuYcIw5swzC1nTIA8fp-bzoucI0R1-GsumEhPMm96yUqTrn_OdUvpDy3vfz0pMkET7XRHeRtFYkXxUiL2ckHZEJddzqWfYSQhZelZqQBQk74WUqwJ-ImlMpCxfob2mYLMmH7CTVpIkFd9W4ClF5XAgzjg\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/eeUWWsxasm0/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"\\u003cb\\u003eGet Ready for the Ultimate Alien Hunt in this Action-Packed Alien Game!\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDive into the thrilling world of alien games, where action and adventure collide. In Find the Alien, you\\u0026#39;re up against an unstoppable alien invasion. These dangerous aliens are hiding among us, and it\\u0026#39;s your mission to track them down and eliminate the threat before it\\u0026#39;s too late!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThis action game takes you on a high-stakes journey across different locations, from eerie neighborhoods to mysterious cities, all crawling with hidden alien dangers. As you explore, use your advanced tools, including a powerful UFO scanner, to identify disguised aliens and stop the alien invasion. Every moment in this alien game is filled with pulse-pounding action, as new challenges and enemies appear at every corner.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWith each level in this alien action game, the tension rises. You\\u0026#39;ll need sharp reflexes and quick thinking to solve puzzles, find hidden aliens, and eliminate threats. Progress through the game by unlocking new gear, from powerful blasters to high-tech gadgets, to fight off increasingly dangerous alien foes.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFind all the aliens in the city suburb and win Alien King. Go to UFO, kill the aliens and free citizens from the alien isolation to win this alien game. Stop the alien invasion in all suburbs.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e Key Features of this Action-Packed Alien Game:\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e•\\u003cb\\u003e Alien Battles:\\u003c/b\\u003e Face off against waves of enemies in fast-paced action sequences. Aliens will stop at nothing to take over, and it’s up to you to defeat them.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e•\\u003cb\\u003e Explore Alien Hideouts:\\u003c/b\\u003e Discover different locations where aliens lurk, disguised as people, pets, or even objects. Each area hides clues to the next alien invasion.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e•\\u003cb\\u003e Unlock Advanced Weapons:\\u003c/b\\u003e As you advance through this alien game, gain access to powerful new blasters and tools designed to wipe out alien threats.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e•\\u003cb\\u003e Challenge Your Skills:\\u003c/b\\u003e Every level pushes your abilities to the limit with intense battles and clever puzzles. The aliens get smarter with each round—are you up for the challenge?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePrepare for non-stop action in Find the Alien, the ultimate alien game where every second counts. Suit up, load your blasters, and defend the planet in this explosive alien adventure!\"],\"Moonee\",\"100,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/aijtdwNPAf6bzE269NO-LCUsdSIRlKecufIP7kEHUlqsL2AOiJTag1qINgTtBUM9SFjRPeLrL5_rYtseXYuNXQ\"],null,[160,152,144,255]],null,[\"Rated for 7+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/1SrNtAwg9PFOhgMJPXehacRTeQNhHhG12Pj1zACHNVmfRfEZA3_oOEmLvRNsmYGeGHpas7sCwyR3y8OT\"]],[null,\"Mild Violence\"],null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/JTT-ImEkrbWzIL7w0fP8fQhVmpexdfh7u0P59PJtyJywmQBVolJjunMal6B5dUM6uiFiKnmtHtBbVvcWBMU\"]],[null,null,null,nu