 – Escape fast before guards catch up and take your egg back\\u003cbr\\u003e🐣 Hatch Meme Pets – Crack open eggs to reveal funny\\u003cbr\\u003e📈 Build Your Empire – Collect more meme pets and watch your base fill up\\u003cbr\\u003e⬆️ Upgrade \\u0026amp; Explore – Boost your speed to reach tougher nests and rarer eggs\\u003cbr\\u003e🎮 Simple Controls – Easy to pick up, fun to master, endless things to steal\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhether you\\u0026#39;re chasing your first meme pet or building a collection of the rarest ones, Egg Thief: Steal n Run keeps the chase fresh with new nests, new guards, and new memes to discover.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload Egg Thief: Steal n Run now and start your egg-stealing spree!\\u0026quot;\"],\"ZENICRAFT Publishing\",\"5,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Qls_VZAEMNQoQS3iF5dQvFM6GKgVjzfxihIYcbo2ZIUuB1phQWBoLMaxWuIrIXVmJUT2wJpbgHzvZPdsNoNOLaU\"],null,[152,194,251,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,[null,\"Suitable for all age groups. Some violence in a comical or fantasy context is acceptable. Bad language is not permitted.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcasual.egg.thief\\u0026rdid\\u003dcasual.egg.thief\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null