://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Qc7z_AzItdbDnNzNffzp7M0tmo4JDhR7EyvfPlkI7JgeMYMd7x07DM-0U4T6qArT0RHY2M-YD6HfmzF6HT7J\"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/MwcHoTBc16PssQD0zuJ4ozgTPrOnYEjBoVZmH8jd_22a5SwsTyKQodwcOKFftwZ0u9q6lP0DgE-gQ-0_INAB\"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/IDS6mePuUMoi9bOgJl4HWffLerdMfUSVAz_1BqisJGfV9hpzdpNxIRFInBaC-eh3gtAjBCtuUSCIlj4qPgr7Yg\"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/9xwXU_iYGpiTLpn-BZaAu3vzlWSvIRo93LgvD5s_1SpX5BF9-R9TFoPyfaiIp4qszcV8k6e9DO7TFREtAw0jSg\"]]],\"My Talking Tom Friends 2\",[\"4.5\",4.53],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.outfit7.mytalkingtomfriends2\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.outfit7.mytalkingtomfriends2\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.outfit7.mytalkingtomfriends2\"]],[\"qgJwGm4IMEoTCP7B8LHHkJcDFTKdbAkdeKQUbPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCQgomCiBjb20ub3V0Zml0Ny5teXRhbGtpbmd0b21mcmllbmRzMhABGAMSGAoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQAQoECAsQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Welcome to the most fire neighborhood around! My Talking Tom Friends 2 brings together all your favorite friends for a next level virtual pet adventure. Talking Tom, Angela, Hank, Ben, and Becca have all moved into a fun filled new town, and they’re ready to share their world with you. Get to know each character’s unique style, visit their homes, and enjoy endless games and laughter in this vibrant Talking Tom and Friends experience.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGame Features:\\u003cbr\\u003eCare \\u0026amp; Bonding: Take care of Tom and his friends by feeding them, bathing them, and keeping them happy. Play with each pet – toss a ball, give a hug, or play music. They even talk now with their own voices, joking and reacting to make every interaction extra delightful!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eExplore \\u0026amp; Decorate: Stroll through a lively neighborhood with lots to discover. Each friend has a home you can visit and style them your way. Design Tom’s music loft, Angela’s art studio, Hank’s comfy cabin, Ben’s gadget garage, and Becca’s VR room with hundreds of cool decorations. You can also visit the local food market, clothes shop, or park for more adventures and surprises around town.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFun \\u0026amp; Mini-Games: Find a great set of mini games and activities at every corner! Shoot hoops at the basketball court, race cars (or lawnmowers if that’s your thing), splash some color with spray paint art, craft and fly paper airplanes, play soccer, and much more. There’s always a new game or challenge to master.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFashion \\u0026amp; Style: Dress your friends in the trendiest outfits and let their personalities shine. From funky costumes to cute accessories, there are tons of clothes to mix and match. Give Angela stylish makeovers, put Hank in a funny hat, or try out cool looks for Tom. You’re the stylist – express your creativity!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCool gadgets \\u0026amp; toys: Play with fun gadgets and toys around town. Fly a drone, launch paper planes, test Ben’s inventions, and more. Every friend has unique hobbies – try them and get to know them like never before.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eRewards \\u0026amp; Surprises: Daily rewards await. Earn coins and bonuses as you play, and unlock new items, clothes, and decorations to make the game even more exciting. Keep an eye out for special events, gifts, and something new’s always happening in the world of Talking Tom and Friends.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMeet the Gang:\\u003cbr\\u003eTom is the playful leader who loves adventures and music. Angela is the creative soul with a flair for fashion. Hank is the chill guy who lives for food and fun. Ben is the genius inventor, always tinkering with a new gadget. And Becca is the bold one, who adds a spark of adrenaline rush to the group. Each friend has a big personality and they all need you to help them live their best lives!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTalking Tom Friends 2: Every day brings fresh adventures and playful moments where fun and endless possibilities await. Experience friendship with Talking Tom, Angela, Hank, Ben, and Becca like never before. Take care of your favorite virtual pets, personalize their houses, and dive into a world full of exciting activities. Ideal for fans of virtual pet sims and anyone seeking exploration and creativity in one game.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFrom Outfit7, creators of My Talking Tom Friends, My Talking Tom 2, and My Talking Angela 2.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThis app contains:\\u003cbr\\u003e- Promotion of Outfit7\\u0026#39;s products and advertising;\\u003cbr\\u003e- Links that direct customers to Outfit7’s websites and other apps;\\u003cbr\\u003e- Personalization of content to encourage users to play the app again;\\u003cbr\\u003e- The option to make in-app purchases;\\u003cbr\\u003e- Items to purchase (available in different prices) using virtual currency, depending on the player’s progress;\\u003cbr\\u003e- Alternative options to access all functionalities of the app without making any in-app purchases using real money.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTerms of use: https://talkingtomandfriends.com/eula/en/ \\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy policy for games: https://talkingtomandfriends.com/privacy-policy-games/en  \\u003cbr\\u003eCustomer support: support@outfit7.com\"],\"Outfit7 Limited\",\"50,000,000+\",null,null,null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/3o28hzgDkxKr4ffmFe2zv_pjF152cf2uXd32qfNMRLOMTDmCjYTxvvtk7oNUTMB6Wv7kf-NgOKEF2vv6nv7_\"],null,[79,171,51,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.outfit7.mytalkingtomfriends2\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.outfit7.mytalkingtomfriends2\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.RC56.crafty.blox.world\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/7tviKTCxykQjI4K30BLJeaEsdQoyJZV8XEgFjmvWrLcvF_5sONxpZfQ4cSZSpQ4msH2ZIU4H3obaW-u_hRJzMg\"],null,[126,120,114,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/O1d6gOZYkseGcfqiIVqmiQQKwOwzIdHIlXLuJSxdDftMjkppVJ7lcAEZgGq4j63y0-FjBGfviCfWWtH6kClq7CU\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/LYwFu8VszHFWm7fN_27UV9ITK64y7bZO6UkFtkpF7JogO-O7vAbuDKImqIPlMMOOyYB7zdlRSDu-L-AJqEBsyA\"]],[null,2,[1080,1920],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Sdffq6BB6KMFwPD86e_mEio1NDCi6ARRgsMna0XXpc6hzQ7HEgGhQhpAxcvmG0EtIzG5UMkmi_-0uIpcoUqddmE\"]]],\"Crafty Blox World\",[\"3.2\",3.25],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.RC56.crafty.blox.world\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.RC56.crafty.blox.world\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.RC56.crafty.blox.world\"]],[\"qgJqGmgIMUoTCP7B8LHHkJcDFTKdbAkdeKQUbPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCPAogChpjb20uUkM1Ni5jcmFmdHkuYmxveC53b3JsZBABGAMSGAoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQAQoECAsQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Welcome to Crafty Blox World – The Ultimate Voxel Building \\u0026amp; Action Adventure!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eStep into a limitless pixelated universe where your creativity meets intense action! Crafty Blox World is an open-world sandbox simulator that combines the freedom of building with thrilling combat and survival elements. Whether you want to design massive structures or gear up to fight dangerous monsters, this blocky world has it all!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBUILD YOUR DREAM WORLD\\u003cbr\\u003eUnleash your imagination with an extensive crafting and building system. Gather resources, mine materials, and place blocks to create anything from simple pixel shelters to majestic blocky castles. Shape the terrain and design your unique base down to the very last block.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eACTION, WEAPONS \\u0026amp; COMBAT\\u003cbr\\u003eThis isn\\u0026#39;t just a peaceful building simulator—prepare for a challenge! Arm yourself with an arsenal of powerful weapons, from sharp melee swords to explosive firearms and bombs. Defend your territory against waves of fearsome monsters and hostile creatures that roam the land.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEXPLORE \\u0026amp; SURVIVE\\u003cbr\\u003eVenture into diverse voxel landscapes filled with secrets, hidden materials, and unique biomes. Meet friendly villagers, tame mounts to travel faster, and discover mysterious ecosystems. Adapt, craft better gear, and conquer the ultimate survival test!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eKEY FEATURES:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMassive Sandbox Freedom: Craft, build, and destroy in a fully interactive 3D voxel world.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDynamic Action Combat: Fight monsters using unique weapons, guns, and explosives.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eRich Ecosystem: Encounter various friendly creatures, unique animals, and dangerous enemies.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCharacter Customization: Personalize your character with cool skins and unique accessories.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSmooth Mobile Optimization: Enjoy colorful blocky graphics and intuitive controls tailored for your device. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThe horizon is waiting for you. Download Crafty Blox World now, grab your weapons, and start building your legacy today!\"],\"Tappy Game\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/FrQjnN3VxnoxnRrm39kUtMi7cnkbUoIj99oxOyjfj2jatlzRll3tf1NWs_X0xC95IztyMGL0fQuorzktlBzU\"],null,[132,206,37,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,[null,\"Suitable for all age groups. Some violence in a comical or fantasy context is acceptable. Bad language is not permitted.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play