iOmpQv7R4yJrWCes6Gotj9_7QMo0OT213thvr8cYRvzAyw\"]],[null,2,[2048,2732],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/AJ-dRlq5rU1A-rNx5X8d8QIkx2UA47P8xyp8UbGVd6Ro-OU3wwZKYV4U7tv2xrJprWUS-T6e1mwfta4XJtG5hQ\"]],[null,2,[2048,2732],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/YO7vDC7yTaXKWVlLCuaZKW1sczchSXR4OeMOYrWK6G9NOH2dgex_KrBCId7QqBLg1YX8FDBdLep1huft7Vbygg\"]],[null,2,[2048,2732],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/lm5aatkZcZ2G846AsY066zqKd8nulMdAfo-iyKPicymZmiThmdaQeZ0dlHKGF3WmkymFbV667kt45gYfucvOjw\"]]],\"Prison Escape - Obby Challenge\",[],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dprison.escape.platformer.runner.obstacle.course.games\\u0026rdid\\u003dprison.escape.platformer.runner.obstacle.course.games\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dprison.escape.platformer.runner.obstacle.course.games\"]],[\"qgJ/Gn0IM0oTCP7B8LHHkJcDFTKdbAkdeKQUbPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCUQo7CjVwcmlzb24uZXNjYXBlLnBsYXRmb3JtZXIucnVubmVyLm9ic3RhY2xlLmNvdXJzZS5nYW1lcxABGAMSEgoECAEQAQoECAQQAQoECAsQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Step into a tense and fast-moving arcade experience inspired by jailbreak games where every escape attempt feels risky and unpredictable. You play as a prisoner trying to break free and survive a realistic prison world filled with obstacles, cops, and constant pressure. Dark corridors, moving guards, and sudden threats create deep shadow zones where attention matters. Each run race delivers a fresh obby prison escape challenge that rewards focus, precision, and quick thinking.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e☀️ Key features of our jump \\u0026amp; run games:\\u003cbr\\u003e- Deep character customization\\u003cbr\\u003e- A variety of game modes\\u003cbr\\u003e- Competitive leaderboard\\u003cbr\\u003e- Atmospheric lobby environment\\u003cbr\\u003e- Simple and intuitive controls\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e👕 Character customization\\u003cbr\\u003eCustomize your 3d character using a variety of visual options. Change colors, outfits, and appearance elements, or apply complete looks to instantly update your style. Refresh your character and stand out during each escape attempt. These options make every obby escape prison breakout feel personal, super expressive, and visually distinct.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎲 A variety of game modes\\u003cbr\\u003eExplore a diverse set of game modes with unique pacing and mechanics. Sprint through trap-filled corridors, carefully move between cover to avoid obstacles and watchful guards, or enter competitive arenas that turn every attempt into a mega test of skill. Every mode delivers a different kind of tension and excitement in break out of jail games.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🏆 Competitive leaderboard\\u003cbr\\u003eChallenge yourself by improving your results and climbing the leaderboard in obstacle games. Track your best results, compare completion times, refine your prisoner escape strategies and aim to improve your position with every new run. Progress on the leaderboard reflects skill, consistency, and mastery of different jump platformer modes.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e📍 Interactive jail lobby environment\\u003cbr\\u003eThe lobby in our open world games is more than just a menu — it is a living prison yard where your escape challenge begins. From here, you can choose an obstacle race mode, customize your runner character, collect rewards, and prepare for the next police escape in our epic games. The lobby connects the experience and leads naturally into intense obstacle course games without breaking immersion.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎮 Simple and intuitive controls\\u003cbr\\u003eThe interface of platformer action games is designed to be clear, responsive, and easy to understand. Smooth navigation and precise controls for backflip and jump actions allow players to focus entirely on obby run escape gameplay rather than menus or complex mechanics.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMaster your fun runs, refine your results, and climb higher on the leaderboard in a true obby challenge within running games. Every new attempt is a chance to surpass yourself and prove your skill.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAlso, in-app purchases are available in the application, which are made only with the consent of the user.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eRead our privacy policy and terms of use:\\u003cbr\\u003ehttps://brainytrainee.com/privacy.html\\u003cbr\\u003ehttps://brainytrainee.com/terms_of_use.html\"],\"Brainytrainee Ltd\",\"1,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/7tAp3AGvSlbtpQQ0A7Sr16FzdHzqDv5RFlqNDoF9Z9V3Tku2pTW1ygDoyxlWI0v6NUbPBBW_ZLE6MDtIxTvJQQ\"],null,[88,84,90,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dprison.escape.platformer.runner.obstacle.course.games\\u0026rdid\\u003dprison.escape.platformer.runner.obstacle.course.games\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]