t8kk73B8bOTIFewLHjqvP_Mqt06r_GkChrVHtpXrKwtMXylSreuA7YQN-3si2mA\"]],[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/DPbXbYbCzpGCEGyew_7ZjpPGT0YFs3vGgwy5XPqFc0nZsjqL5uYjALa9HkRGo9JE_3maLkRtLOhsBNDpKVEK\"]]],\"Tricky Escape: Brain Puzzle\",[\"4.0\",4],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.brainy.puzzle.escape\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.brainy.puzzle.escape\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.brainy.puzzle.escape\"]],[\"qgJoGmYINUoTCP7B8LHHkJcDFTKdbAkdeKQUbPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCOgoeChhjb20uYnJhaW55LnB1enpsZS5lc2NhcGUQARgDEhgKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAEKBAgLEAE\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Think you’re smart? Think again.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEvery level is a ridiculous trap packed with weird logic, silly solutions, and unexpected twists. Nothing works the way you expect!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🧠 Brain-Busting Tricky Puzzles\\u003cbr\\u003eSolve crazy riddles, outsmart sneaky traps, and discover answers that make absolutely no sense… but somehow work.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎭 Funny Story Adventures\\u003cbr\\u003eFollow quirky characters through hilarious situations filled with memes, jokes, and surprise endings.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🧩 Expect the Unexpected\\u003cbr\\u003eTap, drag, combine, and use items in clever ways — sometimes the weirdest answer is the correct one.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e😂 Easy to Play, Impossible to Predict\\u003cbr\\u003eQuick to learn, endlessly surprising, and packed with nonstop fun.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEvery level is a new joke, a new trick, and a new brain-breaking challenge.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload now… and try not to rage quit.\"],\"Era Games Studio\",\"500,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[nu