tisfying smashing experience!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eStep into the ultimate ragdoll sandbox where rules don\\u0026#39;t exist and the helpless wooden puppet is your personal punching bag. Release your anger, relieve your stress, and indulge in pure, unfiltered chaos!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🔥 What’s New in Puppet Bang! 2?\\u003cbr\\u003e💥 Upgraded Ragdoll Physics\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eExperience hyper-realistic feedback! Feel every impact with improved ragdoll physics, snapping joints, and dramatic flying debris for maximum visual satisfaction.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🛠️ Massive Arsenal of Weapons\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFrom classic baseball bats and boxing gloves to explosive Gatling guns, thunder hammers, and sci-fi lasers! Unlock dozens of crazy tools and combine them for ultimate destruction.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎨 Custom Dummy Skins\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMake it personal! Dress up your puppet in hilarious outfits—turn it into a stressed office worker, a goofy clown, or a high-tech cyborg before you knock its socks off.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎧 Immersive Sound \\u0026amp; Impact Effects\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFeel the crunch with high-fidelity 3D impact sounds, hilarious puppet screams, and satisfying destruction audio. Put on your headphones for instant catharsis!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e⏱️ Pick Up \\u0026amp; Play Anywhere\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eNo complicated tutorials, no endless grinding. Jump right into the action in seconds whenever you need a quick mental break.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhat are you waiting for? Download Puppet Bang! 2 now and let the beatdown begin!\"],\"LNet Plus\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Z4WiQmWSxFG8fa6nuHuzCV3K6jSRMy7kwYfU_y1hsVV6IguHrS1j_KxdIHlhkSHpf2v17WAI_Opsh3Z4vtKHgAg\"],null,[250,185,107,255]],null,[\"Rated for 12+\",[null,2,[366,512],[null,null