opCiNjYXN1YWwuZXNjYXBlLnBhcmtvdXIucHJpc29ucnVuZ2FtZRABGAMSEgoECAEQAQoECAQQAQoECAsQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Get ready for the ultimate challenge in Escape Parkour: Prison Run 3D 🚨! This is not just another run game – it’s a wild mix of prison escape missions, Roblox escape style parkour 🕹️, and hilarious meme adventures 😂.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eYour goal is simple: run, jump, and slide to survive tricky obstacle courses filled with moving platforms 🪜, swinging traps ⚠️, and crazy surprises. Each mini game throws something new your way – from breaking out of jail 🏃\\u200d♂️ to trying to steal memes before anyone else grabs them.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e✨ Features:\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFun Roblox escape vibe with colorful 3D art 🎨\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWild mini games from prison escape to meme heists 💥\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSmooth parkour moves: sprint, leap, and slide to survive 🏃\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEndless laughs with trending meme challenges 🤪\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCan you master every prison escape and prove your parkour skills in this crazy Roblox-style adventure? 🌍\"],\"Juudoo studio\",\"1,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/-esEcDZ2U5a6IKfyLRcNvki8ku2TZj1r43GUOeVGmYGJjg7si-JIV1KS5aT9o2fFsOYLIT6szX6JS8CV1X5PZw\"],null,[106,239,254,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,[null,\"Suitable for all age groups. Some violence in a comical or fantasy context is acceptable. Bad language is not permitted.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6