003d\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"GlowUp Spa: ASMR Makeover immerses you in the ultimate relaxing beauty salon experience. Help desperate clients regain confidence through satisfying skincare, dermatology treatments, and dramatic makeovers.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCORE GAMEPLAY\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eASMR Beauty Experience\\u003cbr\\u003eFeel genuine stress relief through realistic ASMR sound effects. Experience authentic squeaking, brushing, scraping, and polishing audio designed to soothe and relax.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eProfessional Skincare\\u003cbr\\u003eTreat severe acne, pop pimples, and cleanse dirty pores. Heal facial wounds, remove dark circles, and apply soothing face masks. Solve dental problems and fix foot skin issues.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMakeup \\u0026amp; Styling\\u003cbr\\u003eApply stunning makeup including foundation, eye shadow, lipstick, and eyelashes. Mix fashionable outfits creating unique aesthetics. Watch dramatic before-and-after transformations.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eRealistic Tools\\u003cbr\\u003eAccess professional skincare equipment including syringes, tweezers, scrapers, and pimple needles. Authentic tool usage creates satisfying gameplay.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCharacter Stories\\u003cbr\\u003eTackle dozens of dramatic character storylines. Experience unique makeover challenges unlocking compelling before-and-after narratives.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eVISUAL APPEAL\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSatisfying 3D graphics with smooth animations. Eye-catching visual design enhancing the beauty transformation experience.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGAMEPLAY FEATURES\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eRealistic dermatology and skincare tools\\u003cbr\\u003eDozens of unique character stories\\u003cbr\\u003eSatisfying ASMR-focused design\\u003cbr\\u003eProfessional makeup and styling mechanics\\u003cbr\\u003eDramatic transformation sequences\\u003cbr\\u003eSmooth 3D graphics and animations\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload GlowUp Spa: ASMR Makeover and become the ultimate makeover master!\"],\"GLADYS GLOBAL\",\"50,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/9hMywveKn0dffqlMDAkeCm_3VOaPdYggLE82A1kkkR-uDhlC6U7tOxcArGyilXoMdwOCVGybmtF_kWsnX7GDk8Y\"],null,[249,174,197,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,[null,\"Suitable for all age groups. Some violence in a comical or fantasy context is acceptable. Bad language is not permitted.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.gladys.glowup.spa.asmr.makeover\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.gladys.glowup.spa.asmr.makeover\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.simulation.fashion.dressup.stylist\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/WO1xi0ei4X1fsxNBNd-IbCc6yZNC8OAVX7uMEwDu7T7bT6vZPuqesQrQJesPyehSupcm8FlNVl_n6ml8msVC\"],null,[205,129,251,255],null,null,null,2