ils?id\\u003dcom.charmcolor.sortpuzzle\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.charmcolor.sortpuzzle\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.charmcolor.sortpuzzle\"]],[\"qgJjGmEIQ0oTCP7B8LHHkJcDFTKdbAkdeKQUbPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCNQofChljb20uY2hhcm1jb2xvci5zb3J0cHV6emxlEAEYAxISCgQIARABCgQIBBABCgQICxAB\"],null,[null,\"Welcome to Charm Color Sort, the most satisfying puzzle game that will test your logic and bring you a moment of peace.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eYour task is simple: sort the mixed colors into individual bottles until each one holds a single, pure shade. With just a tap, pour vibrant liquids, arrange them, and experience the joy of bringing order to a colorful mess.\\u003cbr\\u003eChallenge your mind with hundreds of unique puzzles! As you progress, the difficulty increases, requiring clever strategy and foresight to master. Whether you have a few minutes to spare or want a longer brain-teasing session, Charm Color Sort is the perfect choice.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eKey Features:\\u003cbr\\u003e- Soothing \\u0026amp; Satisfying Gameplay: Relax with a game that has no time pressure and beautiful, fluid animations.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Simple, One-Finger Control: Easy to learn but hard to put down.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Brain-Training Puzzle: Boost your logical thinking and problem-solving skills.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Hundreds of Levels: From easy to expert, enjoy endless sorting challenges.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Charming Visuals: Immerse yourself in a bright, delightful world of colors.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eSo, are you ready to dive into a world of color and calm?\\u003cbr\\u003eWhether you\\u0026#39;re looking for a quick mental escape or hours of satisfying puzzle solving, Charm Color Sort welcomes you with open arms.\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload now, take a deep breath, and let the sorting begin — one gentle pour at a time.\\u003cbr\\u003eSort. Relax. Shine.\"],\"Mario Trevino\",\"100,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/aBFat8TqMFGiS2-hl6q0MOY7mjJXTxC_f4uO08lDoBg6JXmXOvhCBYdxzVilcCCofak6GxcckpSyk65RU-Zs\"],null,[141,90,230,255]],null,[\"Rated for 18+\",[null,2,[366,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/QNpsl4k43vdbfwUAlVLZul2W5O5MUGOToystzghc97mljVHbUwtc639tahcuDsAVHdaGMyZA40AmMVcB_ws\"]],[null,\"Cash Rewards\"],null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/stIOCymv1bYIi3UU_owFeyNt30CkUXbNlDj81ZWtjW9NBIMJxI47i_psYIr0Ho430Rm6mByCGNLORloB\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.charmcolor.sortpuzzle\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.charmcolor.sortpuzzle\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.mini.football.filter.games\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ZKkAEbg8AqslKv7szgokbi3Pt8gzh_QP9pRlGr5N7-XpsAqGmnYgKb1qZwFGDlQU1_61p74vVsnjKmTaYJTr\"],null,[203,199,196,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Uk3L0tauaepMeI7S1kMWWSzPclCFUERdQ_JYAWKVXc8RhDmOIWov2hHENb1GJMjABygqmm9sVEo3nykkAAaBGQ\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleu