Id\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.mini.football.filter.games\"]],[\"qgJuGmwIREoTCP7B8LHHkJcDFTKdbAkdeKQUbPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCQAokCh5jb20ubWluaS5mb290YmFsbC5maWx0ZXIuZ2FtZXMQARgDEhgKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAEKBAgLEAE\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,\"0yGtHv8R85w\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:0yGtHv8R85w?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:0yGtHv8R85w\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1eznS2USKmOXhWwJEuQreA7KcT6Dw49ngsStaPpMFQtF3SRqz_7RrinZCtUuy7YDIxlyizjz-AA0yOE1jEJCm4BppqNRB5yUPrh6nPv-9g2P24sXg6oxxKg9pw0EPOmIbmgEvOHbsUu_LDsX-QVxDmj56jlTrD1ywPIMXxaUCCF7z8s8-CxTgmG9g7p65SpTWp75gF2COUg1xD63ljj3pttubk2g3BK-4st4Jl3o0jm32ZPdakg1RcMGqv229LG4Llmoaytd_D2F74E2IZoSFLKiuD_Qcnxfgf7YLrXBiteEJuw\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/0yGtHv8R85w/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"Mini Soccer: Football Cup 2026 is here. Get ready for fast football and soccer action. Every kick is a new goal. Keep your eye on the ball and win the penalty shootouts. Use your skill to win every match. This is fun and casual gaming at its best.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eForget the brainrot contents. Play a real game with actual viral mechanics. Take on every challenge and reach the top.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhy play Mini Soccer: Football Cup 2026?\\u003cbr\\u003e- Feel the World Cup atmosphere mini-games.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Pure soccer action on your phone.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Take the perfect kick to score goals and bangers!\\u003cbr\\u003e- Control the ball with simple taps.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Win the penalty round under pressure.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Improve your skill level.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Each match is quick and intense.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Pure fun for short breaks.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Simple casual play style.\\u003cbr\\u003e- Follow viral trends in one app.\\u003cbr\\u003e- No brainrot, just a solid game.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eA real challenge for your reaction time.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMini Soccer: Football Cup 2026 gives you football and soccer at high speed. Make the kick, get the goal, and handle the ball. Win the penalty, show your skill in the match, and have fun with casual viral content. This is the game to beat the brainrot and take on a real challenge.\"],\"TSACom\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/8RvzsV_zYI25WuHbp9hp8G2By2JHoHbxhYw6utGUeWd_EAtef9snvigXPMDzsCiHoUb9kNuJCxsSTstcm-FVrA\"],null,[42,51,79,255]],null,[\"Rated for 12+\",[null,2,[366,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/yQChfa9XKlaXMIYTk8w8QwChjT8_SH-_2d2SS-kesw0TLQK1nxtw54bDcoZ09freZJgKrtg4f__is-31Vg\"]],[null,\"Horror\"],null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/YrkR-GP7OKghBTATCoO_jJrchSVrh-NSUBb5DnbRZC1DbLK_cgV9FC2e_iI4GzLsKXuZjuFZajnGCiA8qA\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.mini.football.filter.games\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.mini.football.filter.games\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.mana.stickdemon.slayerfight\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.goog