UmTancH8eucb3IHSZr5WvinTaKdAp_bSUsK4cjcTNU6q8iuA-Uba9n9gCVi7QfA\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/t0Oaywi_xxpBXhJwGNQwkyHVaLT_XhPUBqD0iVC3GOH83g_kKH19m3QxtDGa9FMfmWx-MO6zA1xhomTqCTgdPo4\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/NAk7VEzy7gInB3LvHWq9LrWlDXxIlqu82rc6dUOX2G1gUVdAWDtrYu8dWLI1UnQhRgy8a3mWmT8AaGn9qw5DOg\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/rMl8OT2vV_P1IDhYiXFVXhJuBZamphYyc-kQKtoqFcvxESeeRQ5tfzLif8f5_kkotNtM3kOz-1k0DDN3ZhY_\"]]],\"Bakery Stack: Cooking Games\",[\"3.2\",3.2142856],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.fcg.bakery.stack.maker.game\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.fcg.bakery.stack.maker.game\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.fcg.bakery.stack.maker.game\"]],[\"qgJvGm0ITUoTCP7B8LHHkJcDFTKdbAkdeKQUbPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCQQolCh9jb20uZmNnLmJha2VyeS5zdGFjay5tYWtlci5nYW1lEAEYAxIYCgQIARABCgQIAxABCgQIBBABCgQICxAB\"],null,[null,\"Get Ready for Bakery Stack: Cooking Games with various cakes, cupcakes and donuts flavours on a single click.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAre you smart enough to make a virtual cake? Then play this cake game now.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload this satisfying game now! Move bread on ramp and pass through various gates and add cream perfectly on bread to make sweet cake.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWelcome to the delightful world of Bakery Stack, a sweet and challenging cooking adventure that combines the fun of bakery games and running games! As you dive into Bakery Stack, you\\u0026#39;ll find yourself in a casual game. Channel your inner food maker as you bake donuts that will leave your virtual customers craving for more. The addictive game seamlessly blends the excitement with the art of baking. Imagine a fast paced challenge through the bakery, where your goal is not only to reach the finish line but also to build a colorful sweet stack and the most delicious treats along the way. \\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThis game is not just casual running games; it\\u0026#39;s a flavorful journey where you build a cake. Whether you\\u0026#39;re a fan of baking games, a skilled donut maker, or simply enjoy the thrill of baking, Bakery Stack has something special for you. It\\u0026#39;s a completely fun game that satisfies your craving for both fun and challenge. Download Bakery Stack: cooking games now and embark on a delightful adventure where your skills in baking games and cake games will be put to the test. Get ready to cooking race, and build the cake in casual cake games.\"],\"Fried Chicken Games\",\"50,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/7tyQmTxgOA9dfHWTywt3gd4QVnLueupKF32yMBVAHc-0WIDYkV4YbL_-u8yublKBrqjc4Qo_9Qx1ZqLrdU3k\"],null,[78,245,253,255]],null,[\"Rated for 12+\",[null,2,[366,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/yQChfa9XKlaXMIYTk8w8QwChjT8_SH-_2d2SS-kesw0TLQK1nxtw54bDcoZ09freZJgKrtg4f__is-31Vg\"]],[null,\"Moderate Violence\"],null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/YrkR-GP7OKghBTATCoO_jJrchSVrh-NSUBb5DnbRZC1DbLK_cgV9FC2e_iI4GzLsKXuZjuFZajnGCiA8qA\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.fcg.bakery.stack.maker.game\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.fcg.bakery.stack.maker.game\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\