h.googleusercontent.com/_91i8Pf9XNtgrhXqF-RyQWd2HVWYJpIFa3jpl0AGaD_ERkVRDgk2ZL450DN_Hjoy8RiL-Rdk8BdPRZwWQJwN\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/7s1oydFT2z37RPq9zm_9SV3II989IlssABBFTNV0N41p-qYOQqIMDmLRz__jss_j7kUW2UmL_NMyNAcpeep84Ac\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/34WGzNJMuRiDdqZWqDq-IP86iU_irbauxu9z0YRSe5hSBh4_0uevuGWxxggZnCCJGTWQQIlyKM98fqRkU-xQ\"]]],\"Mob Battle: Craft Army\",[\"3.6\",3.5555556],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.eliten.craft.war.commander\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.eliten.craft.war.commander\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.eliten.craft.war.commander\"]],[\"qgJuGmwIVkoTCP7B8LHHkJcDFTKdbAkdeKQUbPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCQAokCh5jb20uZWxpdGVuLmNyYWZ0Lndhci5jb21tYW5kZXIQARgDEhgKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAEKBAgLEAE\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"Build your own mob army base, grow warriors, craft equipment, and then conquer the enemy\\u0026#39;s lands as a craft commander\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMob Battle: Craft Army is an exciting mobile game that combines strategy and action. The ultimate goal of an army commander is to conquer the lands and build the most powerful force in the ground. You will craft powerful equipment for your mob army and lead your army to conquer the neighbor\\u0026#39;s land. As you progress through this craft war game, carefully manage your resources and make strategic decisions about how to grow your mob army. Decide which warriors to train and which equipment to craft in order to maximize your chances of victory.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHOW TO PLAY:\\u003cbr\\u003e🎖️ Build your mob army base: Start by building barracks, training grounds, and other structures to train your mob warriors. You will also need to build facilities to gather the weapons \\u0026amp;  gold you need to build your mob army.\\u003cbr\\u003e🎖️ Grow your mobs: Once the army base is built, the commander can start growing warriors including craftsman soldiers and craft mobs by using gold. Train your warriors by sending them on quests, fighting in battles, and completing challenges.\\u003cbr\\u003e🎖️ Craft equipment: You can craft equipment in the blacksmiths by using the resources you have looted from enemy bases to improve the strength and abilities of your mob army.\\u003cbr\\u003e🎖️ Conquer the enemy\\u0026#39;s lands: The ultimate goal of Mob Battle: Craft Army is to conquer the lands \\u0026amp; capture their flag. Once the commander has built your mob army, grown your warriors, and crafted powerful equipment, you will be ready to attack the enemies and win the mob battle.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHIGHLIGHT FEATURES:\\u003cbr\\u003e🧱 A variety of units to choose from: Choose from various units of mob/ warrior, each with unique strengths and abilities.\\u003cbr\\u003e🧱 A deep crafting system: Craft powerful equipment to improve the strength and abilities of your units.\\u003cbr\\u003e🧱 Stunning craft graphics and a variety of maps and scenarios\\u003cbr\\u003e🧱 Easy and fun gameplay\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDownload Mob Battle: Craft Army today and start building your army \\u0026amp; join the battle of mob warrior! Be the best craft commander!\"],\"Eliten\",\"5,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/udTK0pfz6tV_tkPfUDRT6_cbDBf9bpowNhVUDUP6zgIhMnh2empvh8O8STfYmSippQ2XMwsRHu9ZIgl7eJyT\"],null,[52,108,72,255]],null,[\"Rated for 7+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/1SrNtAwg9PFOhgMJPXehacRTeQNhHhG12Pj1zACHNVmfRfEZA3_oOEmLvRNsmYGeGHpas7sCwyR3y8OT\"]],[null,\"Mild Violence\"],null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003da