on\\u003cbr\\u003e- Calm \\u0026amp; Antistress Gameplay\\u003cbr\\u003e- Easy to Play, Tricky to Master\\u003cbr\\u003e- Always Fresh Fun\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhether you’re bored, stressed, or just scrolling for something fun, Mini Challenges: Calm Games is your go-to chill game collection!\"],\"UltraPub\",\"10,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/db-pe3etYHMkyJp8L5hfsKLeXVq_ILud79Kc2LxSCt1kum1Gbhyahe1mM2pCwL5ba3DvoUoyl2mjqy42_--oIOo\"],null,[237,235,229,255]],null,[\"Rated for 7+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/1SrNtAwg9PFOhgMJPXehacRTeQNhHhG12Pj1zACHNVmfRfEZA3_oOEmLvRNsmYGeGHpas7sCwyR3y8OT\"]],[null,\"Mild Violence\"],null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/JTT-ImEkrbWzIL7w0fP8fQhVmpexdfh7u0P59PJtyJywmQBVolJjunMal6B5dUM6uiFiKnmtHtBbVvcWBMU\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.u1.relax.minigame3\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.u1.relax.minigame3\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.mandcatgames.partymimic\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/YHdYOl9YyDFaMrcS2b8OFS7_-76ZZEphsZYvtLgPONeWVW6h2aFKRbTAVTedD33sKR10B_H1xgsPvyF4Ch8lp4c\"],null,[99,22,24,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/w2aXapWVzgXc9Kw-DiJwFOfqGOIFTureLxKlSIG_sUrudVUotWSZDEx1tGi3INxaCMenaF5Sl_NV7txI9gfj\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/RwfKIf5CBteXxtfo87-LezDS0gGWCFOsGCSUqMlGywJ7bUAnmJoX2qM1T4iQgHOYE9ecnJjsWjzBuX_zmj8ysrw\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/u98lRyWtm4OH2a-54gdvUBarJapAR0Z3Za2OvUV90HnYDm7W-yUaeQH8Jc6ciH9KAkWkQsU6T1U8x76WOpfhCg\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/eUgpMeGZmic98I_0FmV2ChKyuCOOgB6VaIGGzgC9Yl8BXhv2ByhldQDayJo1-U7idJIb_KcoPqjl0G_k98yHEg\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_SFkcHKoSskiKPBlptXr5Ik3qPJuhST5adszcwWPG-k9BTttmudwzdb50vlC0HO2xhWkAOSqHRT19pNmL0JByg\"]],[null,2,[1920,1080],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/JWhSdhjXLhWXrNmmpuGrJ-WtjFkiqneSn6aIkGPabjFERxQcIDlXZi_zhooew0voGwMs2y_Xqpxc4kO1Q_ERjLg\"]]],\"Party Mimic: Multiplayer\",[\"3.0\",3],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.mandcatgames.partymimic\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.mandcatgames.partymimic\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.mandcatgames.partymimic\"]],[\"qgJrGmkIXkoTCP7B8LHHkJcDFTKdbAkdeKQUbPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCPQohChtjb20ubWFuZGNhdGdhbWVzLnBhcnR5bWltaWMQARgDEhgKBAgBEAEKBAgDEAEKBAgEEAEKBAgLEAE\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"🎤 MIMIC. VOTE. LAUGH. WIN! 🎉\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eMimic Party is a hilarious multiplayer party game where up to 4 players compete to see who can deliver the best — or funniest — sound imitation!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThink you can perfectly mimic a weird animal, a ridiculous noise, or an unexpected sound? Put your voice to the test, listen to your friends’ attempts, and vote for your favorites!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎧 LISTEN TO THE SOUND\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEach round, everyone is given a sound to mimic. Listen carefully — you’ll only have one chance to make your imitation count!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎙️ RECORD YOUR MIMIC\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eUse your microphone to recreate the sound in your own way. Try to be accurate, creative, or just completely ridiculous.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e😂 LISTEN TO EVERYONE\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eOnce everyone has finished recording, the fun begins! Listen to each player’s imitation and discover who nailed it... and who created something completely different.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e👍 LIKE OR 👎 DISLIKE\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eVote on other players’ mimics with a Like or Dislike. Every vote matters, so impress the group if you want to climb to the top!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🏆 GET THE MOST LIKES\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePlay through multiple rounds and collect as many Likes as possible. At the end of the game, the player with the most Likes becomes the winner!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎉 MADE FOR PARTIES\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCreate a room, invite your friends, and turn your microphone into the ultimate party-game weapon. With up to 4 players in a match, every round brings new sounds, reactions, and hilarious moments.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e⭐ FEATURES\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e• Online multiplayer for up to 4 players  \\u003cbr\\u003e• Fun sound-mimicking challenges  \\u003cbr\\u003e• Record your voice directly in-game  \\u003cbr\\u003e• Listen to other players’ hilarious mimics  \\u003cbr\\u003e• Like 👍 or Dislike 👎 other players’ performances  \\u003cbr\\u003e• Compete across multiple rounds  \\u003cbr\\u003e• Simple rules that anyone can understand  \\u003cbr\\u003e• Quick and casual party matches  \\u003cbr\\u003e• Tons of funny moments with friends  \\u003cbr\\u003e• Become the player with the most Likes and win!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCan you mimic it better than your friends?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGrab your microphone, join the party, and prove it in Mimic Party! 🎤🎉\"],\"Rieus Games\",\"100,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/chOXKzMm5DUlqEpJomex6aBKTege5ikwox3y_wBEPg5UkwkbMN26f5jy4ZVlroUKDvsAaAfcMO9oz46hNdbNiQ\"],null,[98,25,55,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,null,[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,[null,\"Suitable for all age groups. Some violence in a comical or fantasy context is acceptable. Bad language is not permitted.\"],[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.mandcatgames.partymimic\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.mandcatgames.partymimic\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.mybogames.mergetown\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"htt