googleusercontent.com/9F6dTKgpot7Wmnwz8K94GC0ySVmfwM1aHidYzWu8ZMWE0Cg3k-cMQ9zq8ioDAsT9MVAdLktY0IQJzQFKr9IqNX8\"]],[null,2,[1242,2208],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ZHC4R30Qsn_rfyWhQYLd5mQoynGTujnsh-ij76pOa2nqZe7kzW7iVi5Mgj2wwrcj44RIlaPKEF3Mzfs9SkdZ\"]]],\"Plants vs Zombies™ 2\",[\"4.3\",4.3090024],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.ea.game.pvz2_row\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.ea.game.pvz2_row\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.ea.game.pvz2_row\"]],[\"qgJkGmIIYUoTCP7B8LHHkJcDFTKdbAkdeKQUbPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCNgoaChRjb20uZWEuZ2FtZS5wdnoyX3JvdxABGAMSGAoECAEQAQoECAMQAQoECAQQAQoECAsQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],[[[null,null,\"0c_iMGs3ehY\",[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/video/lava/web/player/yt:movie:0c_iMGs3ehY?autoplay\\u003d1\\u0026embed\\u003dplay\"],\"yt:movie:0c_iMGs3ehY\",null,null,null,null,\"AXH1ezlIJt3bZEl1zqxqgCuNISb22WsbHV37qI62Dixy1L1fPRil6k79EgeSryaBiC3YPPjuq7jtczUz7E81n8T4fXdeA1LW9AVf9lCrgq2UCSpgxWhNPuTH8T_CkGJjQrIhgqBtucUheNFzMtr1iwKW7Tq1bkGQIt4xq2bSyxZYwALnilKiAIPyNez39p8f1btBmUnOVzntzoK8Pq9uj5a3VphbI7EZpqFdce_kdSVgGh-deVVg88q99cZmqDJLYc342WMtTLqeDo5szpcpNJSOFgTgHwTgRDBQ_I4h_9dOdXfRWw\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,1,[null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/0c_iMGs3ehY/hqdefault.jpg\"]]]],[null,\"This game includes optional in-game purchases of virtual currency that can be used to acquire virtual in-game items, including a random selection of virtual in-game items.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003ePlay the hit action-strategy adventure where you meet, greet, and defeat legions of hilarious zombies from the dawn of time, to the end of days. Amass an army of amazing plants, supercharge them with Plant Food, and devise the ultimate plan to protect your brain.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDISCOVER HUNDREDS OF PLANTS AND ZOMBIES\\u003cbr\\u003eCollect your favorite lawn legends, like Sunflower and Peashooter, along with hundreds of other horticultural hotshots, including creative bloomers like Lava Guava and Laser Bean. Go toe-to-missing-toe with a massive array of zombies at every turn, like Jetpack Zombie and Mermaid Imp – you’ll even have to protect your brain from rampant Zombie Chickens!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eGROW POWERFUL PLANTS\\u003cbr\\u003eEarn Seed Packets as you play and use them to fuel your potent plants. Power up attacks, double-down defenses, speed up planting time, and even gain entirely new abilities. Boost your plants to ensure those zombies are lawn-gone!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eCOMPETE AGAINST OTHERS IN ARENA \\u003cbr\\u003eThink your zombie-bashing strategy is the best? Put your planting skills to the test when you face other players in Arena. Enter Arena and compete against other players to get the highest score on unique levels. Earn coins, piñatas, and more to top the leaderboards, level up through Leagues, and become the ultimate garden guardian.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eJOURNEY THROUGH SPACE AND TIME\\u003cbr\\u003eBattle across 11 crazy worlds, from Ancient Egypt to the Far Future, and beyond. With more than 300 levels, ultra-challenging endless zones, fun mini-games, and daily Piñata Party events, there’s always a new challenge to complete. Plus, ready your best defenses – Dr. Zomboss is waiting to take you on at the end of every world!\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eRequires acceptance of EA’s Privacy \\u0026amp; Cookie Policy and User Agreement.\\u003cbr\\u003eUser Agreement: https://tos.ea.com/legalapp/WEBTERMS/US/en/PC/\\u003cbr\\u003ePrivacy and Cookie Policy: https://tos.ea.com/legalapp/WEBPRIVACY/US/en/PC/\\u003cbr\\u003eVisit https://help.ea.com/en/ for assistance or inquiries.\"],\"ELECTRONIC ARTS\",\"100,000,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/6e4K3WZm9uSjnUkkAK6ozTex-91BXZc6bkjf-1PDinqaPLSDCmvclhvmxa6y930O46SO_z3nJhQcdLiPQvVg\"],null,[243,241,241,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases (Includes Random Items)\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.ea.game.pvz2_row\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.ea.game.pvz2_row\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,[]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.zago.hero.archer\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/6M4AzJdXVgu6JMnOezAg2ATw1HL2VudVf-OsQs_1wykNxUcscoVsklPWkR-g2z_hmx418xADkE_niE0iZlzPDg\"],null,[2,158,247,255],null,null,null,2],[[null,2,[941,1672],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/ABZYg8e-TGEGUSYKx_Z1RhsZSQzMi9sX4OwrIp5p_60lc6DkUrcWBN-DbpgQQrR8Q6ov_3SNSRk9GNZaDJwTjw\"]],[null,2,[941,1672],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_G2ULEhplBZdbgC9D-xDdbgFRHtrEaZTSE9HKgJqe_gnPLMvvgafx2ddBo3fQ3IYFxF1Ak9Cf83lmrZsUCg8\"]],[null,2,[941,1672],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/d1YGDunoFh5dMjZdNRDQcTP3nmmhJUXml0z68wtWFjVi7039hkdl6kD0bq7FpLhtPfy7-PbXhd9ucz71QlWHHGE\"]],[null,2,[941,1672],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/L-ahCqypcBfOw5xaWh8BqxOlKy-1booB5VwgmkId8DRwKpWW9W7UaBw7qkJ9ghcGytVXqTaA19iRLSNBlBGq\"]],[null,2,[941,1672],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/TZcLQuhgdnZi_IjrzKi09kXQPaKyORNJ9GTD4Ssgo90VO8FT0vXnwccPFFVHa3zVnYSnE8SkQxJXq-FTbRjGjhA\"]],[null,2,[941,1672],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/DEBnQsAN6_TAeN7LFAsl1KOQat3lZLdeeb5F-YEz2e2-fWmJ1fg0L-lBhiZjgZoLWLjwDt8QB56RYwpjxf7OuA\"]],[null,2,[941,1672],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/LCx7Aj8_B6koq1DDH88Nf6DoJfQGxQaPtoLg1h9bdNNMnzFA0J-0JKAbFY6I735QgYAeKE59-RKNk9iN8HUM\"]],[null,2,[941,1672],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/aQFvXAIWy8mlPbgq-E-eHGRYJDsB_uMpZnUrINj11WFyV1o6SNGw19TCMVYdPSBSzJTqQCo49xlf-7wRJ-0jtQ\"]]],\"Stickman Archer: Bowmaster War\",[],\"Casual\",null,null,[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.zago.hero.archer\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.zago.hero.archer\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[],[null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.zago.hero.archer\"]],[\"qgJeGlwIYkoTCP7B8LHHkJcDFTKdbAkdeKQUbPoBDwoNCAASCQoFZW4tVVMQALoCMAoaChRjb20uemFnby5oZXJvLmFyY2hlchABGAMSEgoECAEQAQoECAQQAQoECAsQAQ\\u003d\\u003d\"],null,[null,\"🏹 Aim with precision, master physics-based archery, and grow your stickman archer through quests, dungeons, campaigns, upgrades, outfits, and exciting two-player duels.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e⚔️ A NEW ARCHERY ADVENTURE\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEnter a world where every arrow matters. Your mission is simple: draw the bow, calculate the angle, control the power, and release at the perfect moment. Each battle challenges your aim, timing, and ability to adapt to different enemies and stages.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eStickman Archer: Bow Quest combines easy controls with skill-based physics gameplay. It is designed for casual players who want quick entertainment, satisfying shots, steady progression, and several ways to play.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎯 MASTER PHYSICS-BASED ARCHERY\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDrag to aim your bow, adjust the direction and strength of the shot, then release to fire. Arrows follow a physics-based trajectory, so every hit depends on your accuracy. Learn how distance, angle, and timing affect each shot as the challenges become more demanding.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThe controls are simple to understand, but becoming a true stickman archer takes practice. Land accurate hits, complete difficult objectives, and improve your performance in every battle.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🦸 BUILD AND UPGRADE YOUR HERO\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eChoose your character and develop a stronger archer through the in-game shop. Upgrade useful attributes, prepare better equipment, and create a build that supports your playstyle.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eProgress is not only about power. Unlock outfits to give your stickman archer a distinct appearance. Mix character development with customization and make your hero stand out during campaigns, dungeon challenges, and duels.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e📜 COMPLETE QUESTS AND EARN REWARDS\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eA structured quest system gives you clear goals throughout the adventure. Complete battle objectives, improve your archery skills, and collect rewards that help your character progress.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eReturn regularly to claim daily login rewards and bonus gifts. These rewards can support upgrades, unlock new options, and help you prepare for upcoming challenges.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🗺️ EXPLORE DIFFERENT GAME MODES\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🏰 CAMPAIGN\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eFollow a series of stages with increasingly difficult enemies and archery challenges. Improve your stickman archer, clear each level, and continue your journey through new encounters.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🕳️ DUNGEON\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEnter special stages created to test your accuracy and upgraded abilities. Dungeon battles offer a different challenge for players who want to push their skills further.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e⚔️ DUAL PLAYER\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eChallenge another player in local two-player archery battles. Take turns, aim carefully, and discover who can deliver the most accurate shot under pressure.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🌟 KEY FEATURES\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🏹 Physics-based bow and arrow gameplay\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎯 Simple drag, aim, and release controls\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e⚡ Casual battles that are easy to start\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🦸 Character selection and hero upgrades\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🛒 In-game shop with progression options\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e👕 Outfits for character customization\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🏰 Campaign stages with growing difficulty\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🕳️ Dungeon challenges for skilled archers\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e⚔️ Dual-player battles for two players\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e📜 Quest system with useful rewards\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🎁 Daily login bonuses and free gifts\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🔥 Quick sessions with satisfying archery action\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🏆 EASY TO PLAY, REWARDING TO MASTER\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eStickman Archer: Bow Quest is built for both short play sessions and longer progression. Casual players can enjoy the simple controls, while experienced players can focus on precise angles, powerful shots, character builds, and difficult dungeon encounters.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eEvery completed quest makes your hero stronger. Every unlocked outfit makes the character more personal. Every accurate arrow brings you closer to mastering the campaign and defeating your next opponent.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e🏹 Pick up your bow, prepare your hero, and begin the adventure. Aim carefully, release the arrow, and prove your skill in Stickman Archer: Bow Quest.\"],\"Zogo Global\",\"100,000+\",null,\"\",null,null,null,null,[null,2,[500,1024],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/5oNt2uU8K2Iz6o6S4O2H4E-eL-omuBbIDHoVpW3kHt16MK6AMXpkKKwGEe6L9-LyY0V4_WryfN0jwgGsFZR6OA\"],null,[165,228,243,255]],null,[\"Rated for 3+\",[null,2,[487,512],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/EbEX3AN4FC4pu3lsElAHCiksluOVU8OgkgtWC43-wmm_aHVq2D65FmEM97bPexilUAvlAY5_4ARH8Tb3RxQ\"]],null,[null,\"In-Game Purchases\"],[null,\"\\u003ca href\\u003d\\\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\\\"\\u003eLearn more\\u003c/a\\u003e\"],true,null,[null,2,[272,272],[null,null,\"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_re6mcALPaqotePA0WkgYeOQ6TighHRUS62FRmREPEhyZPdGM3QmRjcSpiMt6Pz1O-WZyvEIy4mtGHj9zw\"]],[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://support.google.com/googleplay?p\\u003dappgame_ratings\"]]],[[[[[null,[[0,\"USD\",\"\"]],null,[null,\"Buy\"],null,1,[null,null,null,null,null,[null,null,\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id\\u003dcom.zago.hero.archer\\u0026rdid\\u003dcom.zago.hero.archer\\u0026feature\\u003dmd\\u0026offerId\"]],null,[\"CAE\\u003d\"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]],[\"Install\"],null,[\"CgYKBENBRT0\\u003d\"]]]],[2],null,[1,true,false]],[[[[[[[]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,[\"Casual\"]]]],null,null,null,[],null,null,null,[]],[[[[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],[[[null,null,null,null,null,[]]]],null,[],null,null,null,null,[]]]],0],[[[\"com.princess.makeup.dress.up.littlegirl\",7],[null,2,[512,512],[null,null,\"https